==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall the peons to save up money over a long while. Once your wallet is sufficiently full, spawn your main attackers such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]].

You will want to be very prepared to fight Zang Roo, so fast cats like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] can force her to burrow early, lest she burrow past all your attackers and start attacking your base.

Overall, not too bad of a stage here. It can certainly be rushed as there is no boss shockwave until the Zang Roo spawns and you can knock her back to finish off the enemy base.

